# AI Customer Support Automation

## Project Overview

This is a no-code AI customer support automation project.

The workflow receives customer feedback through Google Forms, uses AI to analyze and classify the message, stores the results in Google Sheets, and routes the request to the appropriate team based on the category.

## Workflow

Google Forms
↓
AI by Zapier
↓
Google Sheets
↓
Conditional Paths
↓
Product / Delivery / Payment / Unclear
↓
Gmail Notification

## AI Analysis

The AI analyzes each customer message and identifies:

- Category
- Main Issue
- Priority
- Sentiment
- Summary

### Categories

- Product
- Delivery
- Payment
- Unclear

## Conditional Routing

The workflow uses conditional paths to route customer issues.

- Product → Product Team
- Delivery → Delivery Team
- Payment → Payment Team
- Unclear → Customer Support

Email notifications are used to simulate team routing in this portfolio project.

