## Example Workflow

Customer submits:

> My phone arrived today, but the screen is cracked.

AI analyzes the message:

- Category: Product
- Main Issue: Phone screen is cracked
- Priority: Based on defined workflow rules
- Sentiment: Negative
- Summary: Customer received a phone with a cracked screen.

The workflow then routes the request to the Product Team email.

## Testing

The workflow was tested with multiple customer submissions.

Different categories were successfully routed to their corresponding email destinations.

Tested routes:

- Product
- Delivery
- Payment
- Unclear

## Project Goal

The goal of this project is to demonstrate how no-code AI can be used to automate customer support classification, data organization, and team routing without writing traditional code.

